# `at`

In [`std/seq`](index.hmd).

```hql
fn at(self, position: Int) : Option<T>
```

The element of `self` at `position`, or `none` past either end; a
negative position counts from the end: `[3, 1, 2].at(1)` and
`[3, 1, 2][1]` are `1`.
<!-- hql reference: end -->
